                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Georgia has one of the worst rates of maternal health in the country.\n\nNearly half of all births in Georgia are covered by Medicaid. At a time when over 40% of Georgia counties are considered maternal health care deserts, we cannot afford these cuts.\n\nIf signed into law, this budget will force more clinics to close.\n\nGeorgia mothers deserve better.",
