                "text": "More than 1 in 3 people living with a disability in America rely on Medicaid. Over 700,000 Americans with disabilities are already on a waiting list for Home & Community Based Services, which are funded by Medicaid.\n\nThe proposed cuts to Medicaid would further limit access to critical services and harm some of our nation's most vulnerable populations. This bill must be rejected.",
